# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599). The Preacher (#131) is alone on coastal forest (44,22) and selected; the nearest village (FUN_4cc6_0356, no filter) is a Tupi one at (43,23).
# Unlock CHEAT (Alt-W, Alt-I, Alt-N), Shift-F1 opens @CREATE; rows 9-12 (pre-WoI) are the four Indian types. DOS ndisasm 0x23ab6-0x23aed:
# FUN_281f_095c(menu id + 9, DS:0x8d50 = tribe.+2 of the village nearest the cursor, x, y), then unit.+0x3147 |= 0xf0 (vis mask 0xf).
# Each created unit must belong to Tupi (nation 11), not the old hard-coded nation 4 (Inca).
# The test ends with cheat mode switched off again (Alt-W), as map_cheat_create_unit does.
